		{"id":"merged","type":"text","text":"**Implemented & merged**\n`module_02_extract/src/` (~5,200 LOC) — `ast_extractor/` (incl. `call_order_view.py`, the D2 lifting), `z3_sym_engine/`, `dynamic_tracer/`, FastAPI `main.py` (545 LOC, `POST /verify`).","x":0,"y":-140,"width":340,"height":150,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"tests","type":"text","text":"**Tests — verified 2026-07-29**\n`tests/` 169 passed + 9 skipped (`sys.monitoring` parity below 3.12) · `eval/` 87 passed → **256 total, ~2s**.\nKnown gap: `pyyaml` used by eval/ but missing from requirements.txt.","x":400,"y":-140,"width":340,"height":150,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"fixes","type":"text","text":"**Fixed this cycle**\n- extract-engine container **never started** — sibling relative-import bug + escape-sequence corruption (PR #76), verified over real docker-compose HTTP\n- Dominance-frontier infinite loop (networkx idom convention, PR #85)\n- Call-order WIR exposed additively from `/verify` (PR #75 on #73)\n- V1-dominance caveat promoted to prominent docs (PR #83)","x":800,"y":-160,"width":360,"height":230,"color":"4"},
